Homepage: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/Filer

Package: filer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: rule-based file organiser
 Filer applies user-defined rules to files: move, copy, rename and tag
 them by attribute and MIME type, matching on name patterns, file types
 and attributes. Files are handed to Filer by dropping them on it or by
 opening them with it.
